# Bandit Level 8

## Objective

The objective of Level 8 is to find the password for the next level.

The password is the only line in `data.txt` that occurs exactly once.

## Commands Used

First, list the files:

```bash
ls

Check the file
ls

Find the unique line
Use:
sort data.txt | uniq -u

Explanation
sort data.txt – sorts all the lines in data.txt.
| – sends the output of one command to another command.
uniq -u – displays only lines that occur exactly once
